Root cause:
The bug was caused by not correctly handling the quoting of bootconfig values that contain double quote characters. The original implementation always used double quotes for values, which caused issues when a value itself contained a double quote. The patch corrects this by using single quotes when a value contains double quotes, ensuring that the values are quoted correctly according to their contents.
